sequenceDiagram
    participant KServe as KServe Inference Logger
    participant ModelMesh as ModelMesh Agent
    participant HealthApp as Health App<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>(PVC HDF5 / MariaDB)
    participant Scheduler as Prometheus Scheduler<br/>(asyncio, 30s)
    participant MainAPI as Main API<br/>8081/TCP HTTP (loopback)
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(sidecar)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant User as User / Dashboard

    Note over KServe,Storage: Flow 1: KServe Inference Ingestion
    KServe->>HealthApp: POST / (CloudEvent)<br/>HTTP/8080, No Auth
    HealthApp->>Storage: Store inference data<br/>HDF5 write / INSERT

    Note over ModelMesh,Storage: Flow 2: ModelMesh Inference Ingestion
    ModelMesh->>HealthApp: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTP/8080, No Auth
    HealthApp->>Storage: Store inference data<br/>HDF5 write / INSERT

    Note over Scheduler,Prometheus: Flow 3: Scheduled Metric Publishing
    loop Every 30 seconds (configurable)
        Scheduler->>Storage: Read inference data
        Storage-->>Scheduler: DataFrame
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Compute SPD, DIR,<br/>KS, JS, MMD metrics
        Scheduler->>MainAPI: Update Prometheus gauges
    end
    Prometheus->>Proxy: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTPS
    Proxy->>MainAPI: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTP/8081 loopback
    MainAPI-->>Proxy: Prometheus text format
    Proxy-->>Prometheus: Metrics response

    Note over User,Storage: Flow 4: User Metric Request
    User->>Proxy: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd<br/>HTTPS, Bearer Token
    Proxy->>MainAPI: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8081 loopback (authenticated)
    MainAPI->>Storage: Read inference data
    Storage-->>MainAPI: DataFrame
    MainAPI->>MainAPI: Compute metric
    MainAPI-->>Proxy: JSON result
    Proxy-->>User: Metric response
